Package: libesmtp
Version: 1.0.3r1-r0
Description: LibESMTP is a library to manage posting (or submission of) electronic mail using SMTP to a preconfigured Mail Transport Agent (MTA) such as Exim.
Section: base
Priority: optional
Maintainer: OpenEmbedded Team <oe@handhelds.org>
Architecture: armv5te
Source: http://www.stafford.uklinux.net/libesmtp/libesmtp-1.0.3r1.tar.bz2
Depends: libssl0.9.7 (>= 0.9.7d), libcrypto0.9.7 (>= 0.9.7d), libc6 (>= 2.3.2+cvs20040726), libgcc1 (>= 3.4.1)
